After managing to win NetHack for the first time here are some of the
differences I noticed between pl9 and pl10 (both ftped from
linc.cis.upenn.edu).

The observations about pl10 are based on a limited experience. So I may
be wrong in some of the observations below. 


******* WARNING: THERE MAY BE SOME SPOILERS HERE *************************















1. Elves get generated with elven stuff.

2. In pl10 you can find more than one wand of wishing. Infact in the
game I won I found 2 wands of wishing, one in the stronghold level and
the other in a level below that (I don't remember exactly which level).
Is this true in general? 

3. Trying to recharge a wand of wishing by reading a blessed scroll of
charging increased the number of charges by only 1 both times. Is this
true always? 

4. I was not able to charge the blessed magic lamp. I tried about 5
times with blessed scrolls of charging. 

5. The Wizard carries 2 Amulets. In pl9 whenever I killed the Wizard the
first time he used to carry only 1 Amulet.

6. Named weapon(s) found in shop(s) cost an arm and a leg.

Natraj.


